<view class="back-space">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state">正在读取活动…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state error">
    {{error}}
    <button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button>
  </view>
  <block wx:elif="{{activity}}">
    <swiper
      class="detail-hero"
      circular
      indicator-dots
      wx:if="{{activity.galleryUrls.length}}"
    >
      <swiper-item>
        <image src="{{activity.coverUrl}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      </swiper-item>
      <swiper-item wx:for="{{activity.galleryUrls}}" wx:key="*this">
        <image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      </swiper-item>
    </swiper>
    <image
      wx:else
      class="detail-hero"
      src="{{activity.coverUrl}}"
      mode="aspectFill"
    />
    <view class="page">
      <view class="detail-top">
        <text class="eyebrow">{{activity.categoryName}}</text>
        <button open-type="share" class="share">分享 ↗</button>
      </view>
      <view class="title">{{activity.title}}</view>
      <view class="body-copy muted">{{activity.summary}}</view>
      <view class="facts">
        <view>
          <text>出发时间</text>
          <text>{{activity.dateText}}</text>
        </view>
        <view>
          <text>结束时间</text>
          <text>{{endDate}}</text>
        </view>
        <view>
          <text>活动地点</text>
          <text>{{activity.location}}</text>
        </view>
        <view>
          <text>集合地点</text>
          <text>{{activity.meetingPoint}}</text>
        </view>
        <view>
          <text>报名截止</text>
          <text>{{deadline}}</text>
        </view>
        <view>
          <text>同行名额</text>
          <text>{{activity.registeredCount}} / {{activity.capacity}} 人</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="notice" wx:if="{{activity.status === 'CANCELLED'}}">
        该活动已被主理人取消，请勿按原计划前往。
      </view>
      <view
        class="notice"
        wx:if="{{registration && registration.status === 'CONFIRMED'}}"
      >
        你已成功报名。出发前请再次查看集合时间与地点。
      </view>
      <view class="notice error" wx:if="{{registrationError}}">
        报名状态暂未同步：{{registrationError}}
        <text bindtap="retry">· 点击重试</text>
      </view>
      <view class="section-head">
        <view class="section-title">这一次，我们去</view>
      </view>
      <text class="body-copy">{{activity.description}}</text>
      <view class="divider" />
      <view class="notice">
        户外活动存在天气与路况变化。请根据自身能力报名，准备合适装备，出发前确认安排；保护环境，不留痕迹。当前仅支持免费活动报名，不收取线上费用。
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="sticky-action">
      <button
        wx:if="{{registration && registration.status === 'CONFIRMED'}}"
        class="secondary"
        loading="{{cancelling}}"
        disabled="{{cancelling || !activity.canCancel}}"
        bindtap="cancel"
      >
        {{activity.status === 'CANCELLED' ? '活动已取消' : (!activity.canCancel
        ? '已报名 · 已过取消截止时间' : '已报名 · 取消报名')}}
      </button>
      <button
        wx:else
        class="primary"
        disabled="{{!activity.enabled || !!registrationError}}"
        bindtap="register"
      >
        {{activity.label}}
      </button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
